{2000}{}{A mean-looking bald man in a biker jacket and stained jeans leans against the buggy. He nods at you.

Taxi?}
{2010}{}{Where can you take me?}
{2020}{}{Where can you take me?}
{3000}{}{I can either take you to the big parking or we can go slave hunting.}
{3010}{}{What's at the big parking?}
{3020}{}{Slave hunting? Where exactly?}
{4000}{}{Big Parking is near the mines and radio station. The Enclave rarely operates in the area, but after the Vault 0 incident, they high-teched the fuck out of the place, installing turrets and deploying robots everywhere.
The mines are fully automated, but the parking lot itself remains abandoned, making it a perfect place to send slaves scavenging. There are piles of scrap everywhere, and they can hunt a few meaty rats while they’re at it.
A no-brainer, really.}
{4010}{}{Let's go. [Jump in the buggy]}
{5000}{}{Get away from me, filth!}
{6000}{}{**leans on the buggy** @@ I get a pass for many things as a driver. @@ Roadkill? I call it lunch.}
{7000}{}{I’ve got a couple of coordinates from our guys. We head over, talk to the locals and persuade them to come back with us.}
{7010}{}{Sounds crazy, let's go!}
{7020}{}{Sounds crazy, let's go!}
{7030}{}{Sounds crazy, let's go!}
{8000}{}{Ready to go back?}
{8010}{}{Yes!}
{8020}{}{Not yet.}
{8030}{}{Yes!}
